    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics is one of my favorite subjects. I’ve always found it fascinating, especially how patterns and logic can unlock new insights. Even though I never majored in it, I enjoy using it in everyday life, from baking to analyzing music scores. My parents’ support helped me build confidence in it early on.",
